   "since": "2026-09-01",
   "unit": null,
   "value": "The Office of Nuclear Energy (NE) is a subagency of the Department of Energy. \r\n\r\nThe NE promotes nuclear power as a resource capable of meeting the Nation's energy, environmental and national security needs by resolving technical and regulatory barriers through research, development and demonstration.\r\n\r\nFor further information regarding Office of Nuclear Energy organization and functions, please visit NE’s webpage at http://www.ne.doe.gov/.\r\n\r\n____________\r\nSource:\r\nhttp://www.ne.doe.gov/\r\n\r\n",
